Steps:
[NAV] {{BACK_URL}}
[WAIT] login form visible (username and password fields present)
[ACT] fill username field with {{ADMIN}}
[ACT] fill password field with {{ADMIN_PASSWORD}}
[ACT] click 'Sign In' button
[WAIT] Admin SPA dashboard blade loaded (main navigation visible)

[HTTP] POST {{BACK_URL}}/connect/token
[SETUP] Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
[SETUP] body: grant_type=password&scope=offline_access&username={{ADMIN}}&password={{ADMIN_PASSWORD}}&storeId={{STORE_ID}}

[HTTP] POST {{BACK_URL}}/api/catalog/search
[SETUP] Authorization: Bearer {{bearer_token}}
[SETUP] Content-Type: application/json
[SETUP] body: {"take": 5, "responseGroup": "Small"}

[HTTP] POST {{BACK_URL}}/api/order/customerOrders/search
[SETUP] Authorization: Bearer {{bearer_token}}
[SETUP] Content-Type: application/json
[SETUP] body: {"take": 5}

[NAV] {{BACK_URL}}/ui/graphiql
[WAIT] GraphiQL loaded
[ACT] enter query:
query {
  products(storeId: "{{STORE_ID}}", first: 3, cultureName: "en-US") {
    items {
      id
      name
      code
    }
    totalCount
  }
}
[ACT] click Execute Query button
[WAIT] response appears in right panel

